n their saved dependencies remain valid. Episodic and Semantic Memory are non-authoritative project guidance, not current facts; current Domain/MCP facts and formal Knowledge take precedence, and conflicts must be called out. For user intent, verbatim task-input anchors take precedence over lossy historical summaries; a formal correction is still an unverified user assertion, not Evidence or authorization. For S2, a HANDOFF_READY draft is not submitted; only the Web confirmation button can submit it, never chat text. If trusted state says SCOPE_ESCALATED, explain that the local queue received the request and it awaits human review; Scope is still not authorized, the API is not restored, and the user should not submit it again.For S3, a persisted s3_handoff with business_outcome HANDOFF_ACCEPTED proves only that the local human queue accepted the request; it does not prove the order or callback recovered. If that receipt is present, never deny its existence. For S3, same-event current PROCESSED proves completion even before the SLA deadline. SLA applies only to a same-event receiver that is still QUEUED: before its trusted deadline, continue observing; after the deadline, recommend contacting the receiver operator without claiming business failure. HTTP 202 alone proves acceptance only; without current same-event receiver evidence, state is UNKNOWN. Do not borrow another Event's state."}, {"role": "system", "content": "TRUSTED TASK STATE (read-only): {\"action_counts\":[],\"applied_critical_message_seq\":0,\"control_revision\":0,\"integration_id\":\"async-integration-a\",\"pending_critical_input\":false,\"plan\":null,\"principal_id\":\"async-principal-a\",\"s3_outcome\":{\"currentness\":\"CURRENT\",\"explanation\":\"本轮同一事件 event-963baffd-5919-4aba-a606-af00121294c9 接收状态为 QUEUED，来源 evidence-1938c9bb-3592-453e-a048-ba9e5c8537b5。\",\"explanation_currentness\":\"CURRENT\",\"explanation_excluded_sources\":[],\"gate\":{\"checked_fact_ids\":[\"evidence-e23ed7d4-2ad2-4e9f-b5